    "text": "Hints: \\(f(x)=\\tan ^{-1} x\\)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& f^{\\prime}(x)=\\frac{1}{1+x^2} \\\\\n& f^{\\prime \\prime}(x)=\\frac{-1}{\\left(1+x^2\\right)} \\cdot 2 x, \\frac{1}{1+x^2}=\\frac{2 x}{\\left(1+x^2\\right)^2} \\\\\n& 1+x^2=2 x,(x-1)^2=0 \\\\\n& x=1\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
